  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Fund adm costs 09-13 - FOS adm costs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civil Society Fund adm kostnader 09-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till colombianska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer          administrerad av Forum Syd. Fondens uppgift &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka och st&#xf6;dja  civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer i Colombia i deras kapacitet att         deltaga, presentera f&#xf6;rslag, f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra strukturer samt influera        officiella policies, med specifikt fokus p&#xe5; fredsbyggande,            konfliktoffer, samh&#xe4;llsstyrning, kvinnor/j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet samt MR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund for support to Colombian civil society organizations adm. by     Forum Syd. The Funds mission is to strengthen and support Civil       Society Organizations in Colombia in their capacity to participate,   present proposals, change structures and influence public policies,   with a special focus on organizations that work with                  peacemaking/building, victims, good governance, women/gender and HR.</narrative>
  </description>
